('127.823.d.9.D',3,'A welder appraises two wires for a structural job and decides on E71T-1 for out-of-position welds. She is:','["appraising appropriate filler metal for the base metal", "choosing by price only", "choosing by color", "choosing randomly"]'::jsonb,0,'Filler appraisal.','original'),
